{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/dwarfs.png?t=1745349876\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/Dwarfshow-export.gif?t=1745349876\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u00a0 </i>Dwarfs are base trops\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Ranged &amp; Non-Ranged</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Magical &amp; Non-Magical</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/elfs.png?t=1745349876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/elfshow-export.gif?t=1745349876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ranged Damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Great Damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No Magical Damage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/Granhars.png?t=1745349876\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/granharshow-export.gif?t=1745349876\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Granhars Don't deal that much damage directly instead they put enemies into fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High Fire Resistance\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lot's Of Fire Damage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/orcs.png?t=1745349876\" /><img cla